<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan c bank takes 8.77 bln rupees in open mkt.</title>
<headline>Pakistan c bank takes 8.77 bln rupees in open mkt.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Wednesday it had accepted 8,775 million rupees in an open market operation in Short Term Federal Bonds.</p>
<p>Figures in brackets show results of the last OMO on August 21.</p>
<p>			Offered	 Accepted	 Max cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sales   7,675 (2,900)  6,825 (2,900)  13.20 pct (13.25)</p>
<p>Five-month REPO  1,500	    1,500	    13.00 pct</p>
<p>Three-month REPO 20		 nil		----------</p>
<p>One-month REPO   450		450		12.30 pct</p>
<p>Total(million rupees) 9,645 8,775</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
